      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d5b7ed86e003434233af7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心里想着这样能不能赢呢，尝试了各种方法后\n超顺利地赢啦♪　就是这种感觉☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "151dc300f91f4756c01310db55b25b07d475ab252b7dc9071244daba8be3dc3a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fe68085101019368d5345f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和勇敢之心亲一起吃了咖啡厅午餐♡　那家店在悬崖上\n去的时候虽然很辛苦，但真的超好吃的♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3abdf91481dbe70f232554b9a7a23dd72519a7bda491bf5683e7fe949934dfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9428ee336e4de6a5c73e4d82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不行☆　因为～，人家已经超努力了嘛对吧？\n到下一场赛事之前休息！　就这么决定啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9342f5b42a841f6cd242a0c5aa9169ed88626da99b45609f2a7b0b46cdab221d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82918924d89f25b3a75564a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。大家……谢谢啦♪\n决赛的声援，要比现在多100倍拜托了哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1832b886ef71b0e9b4c0d363d4d1e55ec404b3fe8c6b79a00a68fca2118aa82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
